{"title": "Mentioned characters", "pageid": 55985, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mentioned_characters", "categories": ["Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mentioned_characters\" title=\"Category:Mentioned characters\">Category:Mentioned characters</a>        </div>\n<p>Redirects here are likely the result of searching for one of the following characters, who are mentioned but neither appear in the game nor have their own page:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Antiope – a <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Breaker\" title=\"Dark Breaker\">Dark Breaker</a> who serves as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gortash\" title=\"Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Portrait_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Portrait_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/00/Portrait_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gortash's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/Portrait_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/Portrait_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gortash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gortash\">Gortash's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">sahuagin</a> wrangler, mentioned in <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aquatic_Labour\" title=\"Aquatic Labour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/30px-Bo